{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0ElMjBQZXJmZWN0JTIwR2V0YXdheSUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"A Perfect Getaway","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wQE7BCTo9sdGEG5hywmC0hz8NoZ.jpg","description":"For their honeymoon, newlyweds Cliff and Cydney head to the tropical islands of Hawaii. While journeying through the paradisaical countryside the couple encounters Kale and Cleo, two disgruntled hitchhikers and Nick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they're being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Thriller","Mystery","Adventure","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"98 min","cast":["Steve Zahn","Milla Jovovich","Timothy Olyphant","Kiele Sanchez","Chris Hemsworth","Marley Shelton","Holt McCallany","Anthony Ruivivar"],"director":["David Twohy"],"released":"2009-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Welcome to paradise. Enter at your own risk.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Steve Zahn","character":"Cliff","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rwrPdKGwXnByxUVMxMf8Y7oswi3.jpg"},{"name":"Milla Jovovich","character":"Cydney","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/usWnHCzbADijULREZYSJ0qfM00y.jpg"},{"name":"Timothy Olyphant","character":"Nick","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ccQzw9I1BYBv0HHVJr4cvAWjtkI.jpg"},{"name":"Kiele Sanchez","character":"Gina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/klmeWImg34TiEia6c6ZkwHhaVoB.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Kale","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Marley Shelton","character":"Cleo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.or